WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.060
Start here on a Fire TV Stick or Cube running Android-based Fire OS.

00:00:06.060 --> 00:00:07.925
Have your remote ready.

00:00:07.925 --> 00:00:10.722
You can pause at any step.

00:00:11.042 --> 00:00:14.736
Open Settings, My Fire TV, then About.

00:00:14.736 --> 00:00:21.069
Highlight your device name and press the centre Select button seven times.

00:00:21.069 --> 00:00:24.763
Press Back once to see Developer Options.

00:00:25.083 --> 00:00:28.816
From Fire TV Home, choose Find, then Search.

00:00:28.816 --> 00:00:33.015
Look for Downloader by A F T V news.

00:00:33.015 --> 00:00:37.680
Choose Get or Download and wait for it to install.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:40.029
Return to Developer Options.

00:00:40.029 --> 00:00:44.593
Choose Install Unknown Apps and set Downloader to On.

00:00:44.593 --> 00:00:50.172
On older versions, the setting is called Apps from Unknown Sources.

00:00:50.172 --> 00:00:53.722
A D B debugging can stay off.

00:00:54.042 --> 00:00:55.224
Open Downloader.

00:00:55.224 --> 00:01:03.500
Choose Home and enter the seven-digit code: six, nine, five, two, seven, three, five.

00:01:03.500 --> 00:01:07.638
Select Go and wait for the download.

00:01:07.958 --> 00:01:13.653
When the installer appears, check that it names TT tv.

00:01:13.653 --> 00:01:15.930
Choose Install, then Open.

00:01:15.930 --> 00:01:21.055
You can turn Downloader's installation permission off again afterwards.

00:01:21.375 --> 00:01:24.410
Speak to your provider about login.

00:01:24.410 --> 00:01:28.962
Open Settings in TT tv and select TV service.

00:01:28.962 --> 00:01:32.503
Enter the details your provider gave you.

00:01:32.503 --> 00:01:37.055
Use their Xtream login for movies and box sets.

00:01:37.375 --> 00:01:41.874
Back on Home, open TV Guide to choose a programme.

00:01:41.874 --> 00:01:45.923
Use the arrows to move and Select to watch.

00:01:45.923 --> 00:01:49.972
The illustrated guide below the video covers the rest.

